<title>FRANCE: Scor shares in block trades.</title>
<headline>Scor shares in block trades.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of 280,000 Scor shares, around 1.02 percent of the capital, traded at 273 francs per share at 0956 GMT, market sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>A further 60,000 shares changed hands at the same price at 1156 GMT.</p>
<p>Shares in the reinsurance group were down 0.33 percent at 272 francs, on volume of 359,285 shares, at 1134 GMT. The market was up 1.03 percent.</p>
</text>
